          "jcr:created": "Thu Apr 21 2022 18:24:21 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h1><span class=\"futura-bold\">Fall prevention</span></h1>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Hospitalized patients are at risk for numerous hospital-acquired conditions. Medications, treatments, and disease conditions can put patients at risk for falling as well. This section provides education on the evidence-based strategy for prevention of patient falls.</span></p>\n",
