          "text": "<h2>Comprehensive Quality Improvement Efforts for Unassisted Fall Reduction<br>\n</h2>\n<p><b>Authors:</b>&nbsp;Susan Clark, DNP, RN, CNML, CNL</p>\n<p>Effective fall prevention requires a collaborative approach with ongoing evidence-based fall prevention interventions and communication. An interprofessional quality improvement (QI) initiative was implemented to reduce unassisted falls utilizing best practices in process improvement methodology.<br>\n</p>\n",
