          "jcr:created": "Thu Mar 17 2022 18:41:35 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h2>Continuous Quality Improvement Results in Sustainable Fall Prevention Program<br>\n</h2>\n<p><b>Authors:</b>&nbsp;Kryssy Enriquez BSN, RN-BC &amp; Sheri Deakins RN, MS, CPPS</p>\n<p>Porter Adventist Hospital recognizes the important role of nurses in patient safety and has successfully tailored a quality improvement (QI) program for fall prevention hospital wide. The following case history describes the hospital’s continuous QI efforts since 2010 to ensure patient safety and reduce preventable falls.<br>\n</p>\n",
